OL,3,GNEWSAMan's sex abuse ruined woman's
OL,4,Achildhood
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who was sexually abused
OL,7,Fthroughout her childhood and teenage
OL,8,Fyears said she could "never live a
OL,9,Fnormal life" because of what had
OL,10,Fhappened to her.
OL,12,FThe victim said her childhood was
OL,13,F"ruined" after being abused by Tara
OL,14,FAthwal over a period of almost 10 years
OL,15,Fin the 1990s, West Midlands Police
OL,16,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
