OL,3,GNEWSAMan's sex abuse ruined woman's
OL,4,Achildhood
OL,5,
OL,6,FAthwal, 77, from Wolverhampton,
OL,7,Fadmitted two counts of indecent assault
OL,8,Fon a girl under the age of 14 years and
OL,9,Finciting a girl under 14 years of age
OL,10,Fto commit an act of gross indecency at
OL,11,FWolverhampton Crown Court on 16
OL,12,FNovember.
OL,14,F"My childhood was ruined and the pain
OL,15,Fhas followed me up until now," the
OL,16,Fwoman said.
